&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Denver, CO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid, periodic travel required&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Target Compensation Range:&lt;/strong&gt; $130,000 to $170,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary: &lt;/strong&gt;Drive client engagements from start to finish by cutting through ambiguity, clarifying priorities, and delivering practical solutions across people, processes, and technology.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Who We Are&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At The Gunter Group (TGG), we are a people-first management consulting firm and proud 20-time workplace award winner. We build trusted partnerships with our clients by working alongside their teams. Together, we deliver practical solutions and lasting impact across strategy, execution, people, and technology. We show up ready to roll up our sleeves, solve complex problems, and make a real difference together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your Impact at The Gunter Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Consultant at The Gunter Group, you partner closely with clients to deliver meaningful business results by taking ownership of workstreams, collaborating with consulting teams, and leading delivery when needed. You’ll help clients navigate ambiguity by defining clear priorities, applying practical frameworks, and driving outcomes that create lasting value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead High-Impact Client Delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a key role in client engagement delivery by leading workstreams and guiding TGG teams to successful project outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flex across delivery environments—working as an individual contributor, part of a consulting team, or as a project/team lead embedded with the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply structured methodologies, toolkits, and best practices to execute effectively and deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace unstructured challenges and turn them into actionable plans and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support Client Growth &amp;amp; Expand Engagements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities where TGG can add value by partnering with client leadership teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support growth within existing and new client relationships through strong performance, insight, and proactive contribution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Account Leads to help develop business and deepen client partnerships over time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate Across Stakeholders and Teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Partner with client stakeholders at all levels—from individual contributors to senior executives—to align on goals and drive outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Work alongside a collaborative team of TGG consultants committed to delivering outstanding client service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Engage with TGG partners, principals, account leaders, managers, and staff who support your success on projects and help you grow professionally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;What You Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;6+ years of consulting or related experience with a strong track record of client service and delivering results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to lead complex, cross-functional projects, bringing structure and clarity to ambiguous environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Depth in one or more of our service areas: program/project management, business analysis, change management, process improvement, Agile, organizational design, or business strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience partnering with both business and technology teams to drive outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong communication, facilitation, and presentation skills, with the confidence to engage senior audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Industry or functional expertise in areas such as healthcare, retail, insurance, financial services, supply chain, or data/technology is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;ERP/CRM/POS project experience and professional certifications (PMP, SAFe, CSM, Lean Six Sigma, Prosci, etc.) are preferred qualifications, not requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at The Gunter Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Salary and Benefits&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supporting the well-being of our team is a priority at TGG. Our benefits package includes competitive health coverage, wellness programs, flexible PTO, professional development and work-from-home stipends, as well as team offsites, social events, and volunteer opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The total expected compensation range for this role is $130,000 to $170,000, consisting of a base salary and variable billing bonus component. Additional compensation may be earned through contributions to account leadership and business development. We discuss compensation and bonus opportunities openly throughout the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why TGG&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Gunter Group is a national management consulting firm headquartered in Portland, Oregon, with team members across the United States. We intentionally build strong consulting communities in key markets while serving clients nationwide. Our consultants work across remote, hybrid, and onsite environments depending on client needs, with travel expectations varying by engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We partner with organizations across industries including retail, apparel, government, education, insurance, and Fortune 100 companies, working alongside client teams to solve complex problems and deliver practical solutions that drive lasting results. Our work is rooted in strong relationships, thoughtful execution, and a shared commitment to doing quality work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At TGG, we believe people do their best work when they feel respected, supported, and included. We are committed to fostering an engaging, fair, and authentic environment where diverse backgrounds and perspectives are valued. Our culture is guided by non‑negotiable values—including integrity, curiosity, emotional intelligence, collaboration, confidence, and the ability to thrive in ambiguity—and by a high standard of excellence in how we show up for our clients and each other.&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Gunter Group LLC is an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
